{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess of Mana</strong> is chess with a <strong>twist</strong> \u2014 a magical battlefield where capturing pieces ain\u2019t the end... it\u2019s just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant fantasy world, <strong>Celts and Orcs face off with strategy <i>and</i> a little magical boost called Mana</strong> \u2014 with it, you can bring fallen pieces back to life and flip the game in wild, unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget being scared to make bold moves and lose your pieces! In <strong>Chess of Mana</strong>, every turn can spark a comeback, and every piece you lose might just rejoin the fight. Here, <strong>the King\u2019s not just some target \u2014 he\u2019s the one holding all the Mana power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/773b768451eef6cf708503969ac85efb.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/01abd5d2a8f6ddb90929253d3dda9e85.poster.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/01abd5d2a8f6ddb90929253d3dda9e85.webm?t=1763648830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new way to play Chess where pieces can come back to the battlefield! Chess of Mana flips traditional strategy on its head and brings fresh tactical styles to the board. The fact that your pieces can return to the game adds a whole new layer of chaos\u2014uh, we mean strategy\u2014and has left many seasoned players scratching their heads trying to keep up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/c6eb7a2b4fb7b37d5786d179dcce5973.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/7c43ee1b0a7e3998aaff99147b45feac.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re more into the traditional chess vibes... don\u2019t worry, we\u2019ve got you covered! You can still enjoy Classic Chess mode with the charming pixel art style of Chess of Mana and its epic soundtrack. Let\u2019s be honest\u2014watching little pixelated characters run across the board and smack each other around is way more fun than regular ol' chess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/b8e742515b3051c15833e76d420226ad.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/f41105c0c48ec10cf72381a3d93bda06.poster.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/f41105c0c48ec10cf72381a3d93bda06.webm?t=1763648830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess of Mana brings the battlefield to life with unique art direction and spicy animations that make each capture feel like a dramatic showdown. Trust us, it\u2019s very satisfying to take out a piece when it explodes in a burst of pixelated glory. Just wait until you see the queens unleash their powers\u2014it's seriously cool, man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/2d5cc5076561b19fd0f35fa59fef3852.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/e7482a325a69162e5682cd67dd0ef1ec.poster.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/e7482a325a69162e5682cd67dd0ef1ec.webm?t=1763648830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In war, the battlefield is always someone\u2019s homeland. That\u2019s why Chess of Mana features themed boards that set the tone for each glorious skirmish! We went all in on the pixel art here, so yes, we\u2019re definitely calling that a major selling point. You're welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778350?t=1763648830","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/28e9edd2ffdbca0ee1e47e90b8fc61e9d9d6abd5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763648830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/28f035ef46a49694782df7994c40d361f8d65179/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763648830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/28f035ef46a49694782df7994c40d361f8d65179/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763648830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4073520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess of Mana</strong> is chess with a <strong>twist</strong> \u2014 a magical battlefield where capturing pieces ain\u2019t the end... it\u2019s just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant fantasy world, <strong>Celts and Orcs face off with strategy <i>and</i> a little magical boost called Mana</strong> \u2014 with it, you can bring fallen pieces back to life and flip the game in wild, unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget being scared to make bold moves and lose your pieces! In <strong>Chess of Mana</strong>, every turn can spark a comeback, and every piece you lose might just rejoin the fight. Here, <strong>the King\u2019s not just some target \u2014 he\u2019s the one holding all the Mana power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/773b768451eef6cf708503969ac85efb.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor