830\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/f41105c0c48ec10cf72381a3d93bda06.poster.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/f41105c0c48ec10cf72381a3d93bda06.webm?t=1763648830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess of Mana brings the battlefield to life with unique art direction and spicy animations that make each capture feel like a dramatic showdown. Trust us, it\u2019s very satisfying to take out a piece when it explodes in a burst of pixelated glory. Just wait until you see the queens unleash their powers\u2014it's seriously cool, man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/2d5cc5076561b19fd0f35fa59fef3852.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/e7482a325a69162e5682cd67dd0ef1ec.poster.avif?t=1763648830\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/e7482a325a69162e5682cd67dd0ef1ec.webm?t=1763648830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In war, the battlefield is always someone\u2019s homeland. That\u2019s why Chess of Mana features themed boards that set the tone for each glorious skirmish! We went all in on the pixel art here, so yes, we\u2019re definitely calling that a major selling point. You're welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Monk Monkey"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/1d7856002d1032075f03a417893961cf9ef161a8/header.jpg?t=1763648830","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3778350/1104015228/40631b0f5d5f5f202e4ba40e65c730a9588c1ddc/1760118233/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760387936","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3778350/1104015228/40631b0f5d5f5f202e4ba40e65c730a9588c1ddc/1760118233/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760387936","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3778350/1104015228/40631b0f5d5f5f202e4ba40e65c730a9588c1ddc/1760118233/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760387936","id":257173984,"name":"Chess of Mana Trailer Portugu\u00eas","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173984/ef19985058672403fee751c6c470866e1ed73680/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760387936"}],"name":"Chess of Mana","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-1115G4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"